><span leaf=\"\">浦宝婧律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">从法律基础理论入手，系统阐释了知识产权的法律内涵与保护体系。她结合《商标法》《著作权法》《专利法》《反不正当竞争法》等知识产权法律法规，清晰界定了餐饮企业常见的商标权、著作权、专利权等知识产权形态的法律特征与保护规定。浦律师精选了数个具有典型意义的司法判例进行深度解读，生动展示了司法实践中企业知识产权的保护情况与裁判思路。浦律师为在座餐饮企业防范商标风险提供了指引，帮助企业建立对知识产权法律体系的整体认知。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 70%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Z0V23I8WqyJrvJYc6nMX6t1UN78zCia27kNqsebgndj0E1b3HJbHUNLYyfQ8LTFvcl7gJqn3hApUKSibMeO0J9Fw/640?wx_fmt=gif#imgIndex=9\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder __bg_gif\" data-ratio=\"0.232\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"500\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(4.31034) / 1; width: 474px !important; height: auto !important;\" width=\"100%\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"12\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" data-order=\"4\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 92%;vertical-align: top;align-self: fl